00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:04.700
And then what they want to do

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:05.700
is they want to put you in a situation

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:06.700
where they drain your resources.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.700
So they may freeze your bank accounts,

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.700
freeze your retirement accounts,

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.700
stop any payments.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:13.700
If you were retired and you were getting payments,

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:14.700
they stopped those.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.700
There it is.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.700
And the number one answer way to do it is,

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:19.700
by you not having any money to defend yourself,

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:22.700
then you're stuck either defending yourself as a pro se,

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:25.700
or you can go with the next negative solution,

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.700
which is a public pretender,

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.700
also known as a public defender.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.700
But that person will do nothing

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.700
other than do a plea negotiation.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.700
And then usually what they do

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:35.700
when you're not complying,

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.700
that they offer you a deal that you think is unacceptable,

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.700
here comes the superseding indictment.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.700
That's right.

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.700
Usually they threat,

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:43.700
or if they don't bring the superseding indictment,

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.700
they threaten you with the superseding indictment.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:46.700
Repeatedly.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.700
Right.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.700
So they'll tell you,

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.700
if you don't take this deal,

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:50.700
it's the last deal you ever see.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.700
And we're going to come up with three more charges

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.700
and you'll be looking at 50 years to life.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.700
That's exactly what they did.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:57.700
It's a non-compliance.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.700
They never look at the substantive issues.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.700
And then they give you what I call

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:04.700
is a massively curated set of discovery.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.700
Of course, they go through the discovery

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.700
and anything that is exculpatory material

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.700
just disappears, gets destroyed.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.700
You don't get that.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.700
You only get the inculpatory.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:14.700
And of course, in your case,

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.700
you bring up, you know,

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:16.700
when I think of Brennan,

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.700
I always think of Brennan, Clapper and Comey.

