who actually put the cuffs on me.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:27.700
You see, I mean,

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.700
these guys are just the scum.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:30.700
I didn't know that,

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.700
but I got to tell you,

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:32.700
these are guys,

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:33.700
and this is what I understand

