Interesting.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.700
So my question from your years of work

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.700
with CIA, your expertise,

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.700
what form of interrogation works best?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:19.700
Obviously, we're not,

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:20.700
we don't want torture,

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.700
but what is it?

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.700
It's rapport building.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.700
Sometimes it takes days, weeks,

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:27.700
even months,

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.700
but rather than tying the guy to a chair

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.700
and beating him in the face,

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.700
or waterboarding him,

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.700
you get so much more information,

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.700
good information, actionable intelligence

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:42.700
by offering him a cup of tea,

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.700
an orange,

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.700
if he's really cooperative,

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:46.700
a piece of paper and a pen

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.700
to write to his parents.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.700
You'd be surprised what these guys

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.700
will give you.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.700
When you treat them with respect,

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.700
it's really all it comes down to.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.700
To him like a human being.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:58.700
Yeah, exactly.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.700
I think that if you really want to develop a source,

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:04.700
you have to develop a very trusting rapport.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:06.700
If we were developing sources years ago

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.700
when we had to communicate with people,

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.700
you would try to develop a relationship

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.700
that was built on trust.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.700
Probably the secondary successful tool

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.700
I saw was when people would say,

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.700
well, you need to help us,

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.700
or your family's going to have a problem.

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.700
Guys would usually,

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.700
that was a secondary that didn't require violence,

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:27.700
but just that they thought their family

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.700
or their parents were going to be impacted.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:31.700
That immediately would get,

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.700
if you had to get to that point,

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.700
you could get some kind of cooperation at that level,

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.700
but you're right.

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:39.700
I think the soft touch always worked better.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.700
Oh my God, there's no comparison.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.700
If I could tell you a short little story.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.700
If I blew the whistle,

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.700
I was approached by Liberty University

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.700
