00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.700
and Introduction to Intelligence Analysis.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.700
The Dean of the school

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.700
gave a final exam that year.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.700
That was so impactful.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.700
It's been in my mind ever since.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.700
It was very, very simple.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.700
It was four questions.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:18.700
There's a bomb that's going to go off

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.700
