00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:24.700
You've captured a leader of Al Qaeda.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.700
You know that he has the information.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:29.700
You need to disrupt this attack.

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:31.700
Do you torture him?

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.700
Yes, no, and explain.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.700
The next question was,

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.700
he didn't give you anything,

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.700
but you've captured his wife

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.700
and you know that she has knowledge

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.700
of the attack that's coming.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.700
Do you torture her?

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:46.700
Yes, no, explain.

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:47.700
Third question,

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:49.700
the wife is a true believer,

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:51.700
but you have their kids in custody.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.700
So do you torture their kids

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.700
to make the parents talk

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.700
so you can disrupt this attack

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:58.700
and save American lives?

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:00.700
Yes, no, and explain yourself.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.700
The fourth question was,

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:06.700
you've died and you're at the Gates of Heaven

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.700
and Peter says to you,

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.700
come on in, Jesus wants to talk to you.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.700
You go in and he says,

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.700
explain your actions.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.700
What do you tell him?

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.700
It was such a simple example.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.700
It was such a simple question

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.700
and it cut right to the core of this.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.700
When they first called me,

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:32.700
